#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:27
msgid "The container is running. Stop it before deleting it."
msgstr "容器正在运行，请先停止再删除。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:32
msgid "The image is in use by a container and cannot be deleted."
msgstr "该镜像正被容器使用，无法删除。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:35
msgid ""
"The image has more than one tag. Force deletion removes all of its tags."
msgstr ""
"该镜像有多个标签；强制删除会移除它的全部标签。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:39
msgid "The name is already in use."
msgstr "该名称已被占用。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:41
msgid "The Docker daemon rejected the request because of the current state."
msgstr "由于当前状态，Docker 守护进程拒绝了该请求。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:52
msgid "Docker Engine is not reachable."
msgstr "无法连接到 Docker 引擎。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:54
msgid "Could not connect to the Docker daemon."
msgstr "无法连接到 Docker 守护进程。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:56
msgid "Permission denied while accessing the Docker socket."
msgstr "访问 Docker socket 时权限不足。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:58
msgid "The Docker daemon did not respond in time."
msgstr "Docker 守护进程响应超时。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:60
msgid "This Docker Engine version is not supported by Kontainer."
msgstr "Kontainer 不支持该 Docker 引擎版本。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:62
msgid ""
"The object no longer exists. It may have been removed outside Kontainer."
msgstr ""
"该对象已不存在，可能是被 Kontainer 之外的工具删除了。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:66
msgid "The action was not started because a precondition was not met."
msgstr "前置条件不满足，操作未开始。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:68
msgid "The Docker daemon rejected the request."
msgstr "Docker 守护进程拒绝了该请求。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:70
msgid "The Docker daemon reported an internal error."
msgstr "Docker 守护进程报告内部错误。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:72
msgid "The Docker daemon returned an unreadable response."
msgstr "Docker 守护进程返回了无法解析的响应。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:74
msgid "The Docker daemon returned unexpected data."
msgstr "Docker 守护进程返回了意外数据。"

#: src/model/docker_error_text.cpp:76
msgid "Unknown Docker error."
msgstr "未知的 Docker 错误。"

#: src/model/operation_controller.cpp:143
msgid ""
"The Docker daemon refused the last write operation because of missing "
"permissions. Kontainer switched to read-only for this session."
msgstr ""
"由于权限不足，Docker 守护进程拒绝了下一次写操作。Kontainer 已在本次会话中切换为只读。"

#: src/model/operation_controller.cpp:145
msgid ""
"Kontainer can only read from this Docker socket: the current user is not "
"allowed to write it. Add the user to the group that owns the socket, or use "
"a rootless Docker setup."
msgstr ""
"Kontainer 只能读取该 Docker socket：当前用户没有写权限。"
"请把该用户加入 socket 所属的组，或改用 rootless Docker 部署。"

#: src/model/operation_controller.cpp:148
msgid ""
"The Docker socket does not exist, so containers and images cannot be managed."
msgstr ""
"Docker socket 不存在，因此无法管理容器与镜像。"

#: src/model/operation_controller.cpp:150
msgid ""
"Managing containers and images is only available for the local Docker socket."
msgstr ""
"仅本机 Docker socket 支持管理容器与镜像。"

